(text "Pack-referenced control outputs / default shutdown" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9bb1b1f2-c43d-55ba-b911-da11bcb75525"))
(text "SKY66423 requires controls near GND or VCC0 for specified sleep current.\n3.3 V GPIO is not a full-height logic high when PACK+ is 4.05 V.\nTwo-transistor level translation gives non-inverting 0 / PACK+ outputs.\nDefault MCU reset state keeps all three FEM controls LOW; no floating mode pins." (at 20 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aa9c2a04-df12-50cc-929f-910f857c3d51"))
(text "Current audit" (at 25 257 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f3d5587b-5a35-5ad0-8a1a-08107dcca8ad"))
(text "LOW outputs have no DC resistor current. A HIGH output draws ~8uA through\nthe gate pullup and output pulldown at PACK=4.05V. Allow >=1ms settling after\nmode changes. Qualify transistor leakage and FEM shutdown current on the bench." (at 25 263 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4acc6b23-5ee7-574c-8faf-c535cde929fa"))
